	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi tuas per hunc <placeName ref="l176">Glaronensem</placeName> et ago pietati <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>tuae maximas gratias, praesertim pro fideli consilio, quod <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>mihi in negotio novę illius confoederationis communicasti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Remitto illud tibi; sed miror, qui factum sit, quod <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>reclusum sive apertum et tantum primo folio tuae postremę <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ad <persName ref="p458">Brentium</persName> responsionis, quam Repetitionem vocas, invo<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>lutum a praefecto <placeName ref="l280">Lausanensi</placeName> <persName>Petermanno ab Erlach</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>qui nuncium illuc miserat, ad me transmissum sit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Ego transscripsi ex eo, quę videbantur, hodie nec putavi <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>hunc nuncium tam cito ex <placeName ref="l922">Friburgo</placeName> rediturum; alioqui <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>copiosius ad te scriberem; sub noctem enim redit et cras <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>summo mane, quando mihi etiam concionandum est, iterum <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>discedet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Res haec me valde etiam sollicitum tenet, et <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>vereor valde, ne in gravem inducamur tentationem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Scribit <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> ad nostros, et ut est astutus satis, novit, quos sollici<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>tare debeat; urget ergo et instat, nec desunt, qui illum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>hic audiant, qui alias vix audirent.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Praetextus est plau<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sibilis, res ipsa putrida tota.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Oro dominum, ne nos inducat <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>in tentationem.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName>Mareschallus de Villevilla</persName> cum ar<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>chiepiscopo <placeName>Lemovicensi</placeName> proxima Martis huc venerunt; <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nudiustertius et heri auditi sunt, prius a senatu, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>postea a diacosiis.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quid proposuerint et quid ipsis responsum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>sit, certo nondum scribere possum, cum fidorum <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>neminem adhuc de his disserentem audire potuerim; scis <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tamen propediem.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Proficiscuntur nunc <placeName ref="l300">Lucernam</placeName>; nam a <placeName ref="l760">So<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>lodoro</placeName> propter pestem illic quoque ingruentem declinant.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Veni<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ent etiam <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> vobiscum nimirum acturi, quod et hic egerunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Beldii quoque literas remitto; scripsit idem ad me quoque de rebus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>iisdem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Ich sorg noch immerdar, es geb nüt guͦts, <foreign xml:lang="la">et vereor r<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>eliquos non satis fidos esse</foreign>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Von <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName> ist sonst nüt, dann <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>das ich von her <persName ref="p8419">Jörg Obrechten</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Georg Obrecht, Freund Calvins, s. u.a. Beza-Korrespondenz.</note> von Leon, so diser tagen <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>auch hie gsin, verston, der hertzog von <placeName ref="l2478">Saffoy</placeName> enbüte <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sich alles guͦts gegen inen und förchte wol so übel, wir <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>haltind den friden nitt an imm als er an uns.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Gott geb, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>das es als guͦt werd!</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Min herren handlend sonst den <placeName ref="l167">Genfferen</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>alles zuͦ guͦtem; dann, so krieg sölt werden, davor gott <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>sige, wurde es den <placeName ref="l167">Genfferen</placeName> wol als schwär als sonst je<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>man.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">So dann der friden bschloßen, wirt man immerdar handlen, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>was müglich, das si auch zruͦwen sigind.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Man meints <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>beßer mitt inen, dann sis verstandind.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Haec nunc rap<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>tim; proxime plura dabo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Salvi sint omnes tui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>19. augusti sub noctem 1564.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I[ohannes] <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>Hallerus</persName>, tuus <lb xml:id="p1z46"/>omnino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z47"/>Fratrem ex me saluta, cui iam scribere<note type="margin">a.R.: scriberem!</note> n<lb xml:id="p1z48"/>on possum; <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>sunt enim mihi <placeName ref="l176">Glaronam</placeName> quoque adhuc scribendę literae.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>vigilantissimo pastori, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>meo et compatri summa <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>pietate colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
